# Firebase config (from Project settings → Your apps → web app config).
# These values aren't secret — Firestore access is controlled by security
# rules, not by hiding this config — but keep .env.local out of git anyway
# so each environment can point at its own project if needed.
VITE_FIREBASE_API_KEY=
VITE_FIREBASE_AUTH_DOMAIN=
VITE_FIREBASE_PROJECT_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_STORAGE_BUCKET=
VITE_FIREBASE_MESSAGING_SENDER_ID=
VITE_FIREBASE_APP_ID=
